    "title": "2026 Masters how to watch, tee times, TV channel: Keep up with Rory Mcllroy, Scottie Scheffler and others at Augusta National",
    "text": "We’re one day into the 2026 Masters, and Rory McIlroy is back on top.McIlroy posted a 5-under 67 on Thursday to jump to the top of the leaderboard at Augusta National, and looked very capable of defending his green jacket. He joined Sam Burns at the top after the first round, and the two will take a two-shot lead into Friday.AdvertisementLike last year, when he came so close to ending McIlroy’s Grand Slam bid, Justin Rose is right in the mix. He entered the clubhouse at 2-under, though he finished the day with back-to-back bogeys to fall off. Kurt Kitayama, Jason Day and Patrick Reed will enter Friday at 3-under.Scottie Scheffler, the top-ranked golfer in the world, opened the day by going 3-under in his first three holes, but he ended up finishing with the group at 2-under.The two biggest LIV Golf members struggled, too. Bryson DeChambeau, with his 3-D printed iron, went 4-over on the day with a bad triple-bogey on the back side. Jon Rahm was worse at 6-over. Both guys will have to fight hard to even make it into the weekend despite starting the tournament as favorites.Here’s everything you need to know to keep up with the second-round action at the Masters on Friday.AdvertisementSecond round tee timesAll times ET 7:40 a.m.: Samuel Stevens; Sungjae Im 7:50: Andrew Novak; Tom McKibbin; Brian Campbell 8:02: Mike Weir; Wyndham Clark; Mateo Pulcini 8:14: Zach Johnson; Michael Kim; Nicolai Hojgaard 8:26: Danny Willett; Davis Riley; Ethan Fang 8:38: Adam Scott; Daniel Berger; Brian Harman 8:50: Fred Couples; Min Woo Lee; Fifa Laopakdee 9:02: Sergio Garcia; Aaron Rai; Jacob Bridgeman 9:19: Harry Hall; Corey Conners; Michael Brennan 9:31: J.J. Spaun; Maverick McNealy; Tyrrell Hatton 9:43: Jon Rahm; Chris Gotterup; Ludvig Åberg 9:55: Jordan Spieth; Justin Rose; Brooks Koepka 10:07: Sepp Straka; Ben Griffin; Justin Thomas 10:19: Scottie Scheffler; Robert MacIntyre; Gary Woodland 10:31: Harris English; Marco Penge; Si Woo Kim 10:51: John Keefer; Haotong Li (China) 11:03: Naoyuki Kataoka; Max Homa; Carlos Ortiz 11:15: Jose Maria Olazabal; Rasmus Neergaard-Petersen; Aldrich Potgieter 11:27: Angel Cabrera; Sami Valimaki; Jackson Herrington 11:39: Charl Schwartzel; Max Greyserman; Ryan Fox 11:51: Vijay Singh; Matt McCarty; Rasmus Hojgaard 12:03 p.m.: Kurt Kitayama; Kristoffer Reitan; Casey Jarvis 12:15: Bubba Watson; Nicolas Echavarria; Brandon Holtz 12:32: Cameron Smith; Sam Burns; Jake Knapp 12:44: Keegan Bradley; Ryan Gerard; Nick Taylor 12:56: Dustin Johnson; Shane Lowry; Jason Day 1:08: Patrick Reed; Tommy Fleetwood; Akshay Bhatia 1:20: Bryson DeChambeau; Matt Fitzpatrick; Xander Schauffele 1:32: Hideki Matsuyama; Collin Morikawa; Russell Henley 1:44: Rory McIlroy; Cameron Young; Mason Howell 1:56: Viktor Hovland; Patrick Cantlay; Alex NorenAdvertisementAll times ETFriday, April 10 | Round 2Amazon Prime Video: 1-3 p.m. ESPN: 3-7:30 p.m.Saturday, April 11 | Round 3Paramount+: 12-2 p.m. CBS: 2-7 p.m.Sunday, April 12 | Round 4Paramount+: 12-2 p.m. CBS: 2-7 p.m.",
